**Bus contract:**
- Subscribes: `composer/palette/selected`, `composer/palette/drag_end`, `composer/tool/mode`, `composer/tool/snap_enabled`, `composer/tool/grid_size`, `composer/tool/show_bindings`, `composer/config/widget_changed`, `composer/config/module_changed`, `composer/binding/created`, `composer/binding/modified`, `composer/binding/removed`
- Publishes: `composer/selection/type`, `composer/selection/widget_id`, `composer/selection/module_id`, `composer/selection/multi`, `composer/selection/binding_id`, `composer/canvas/widget_added`, `composer/canvas/widget_removed`, `composer/canvas/widget_moved`, `composer/canvas/widget_resized`, `composer/canvas/module_added`, `composer/canvas/module_removed`, `composer/canvas/layout_changed`, `composer/canvas/viewport`, `composer/command/execute`

**Input specs:**
- [CXC-MOD-CANVAS] from 03-composer-modules.lts
