### [CXC-AGENT-F] Agent F: History + Serialization

**Files:**
- `src/composer/modules/history.py`
- `src/composer/serialization/__init__.py`
- `src/composer/serialization/loader.py`
- `src/composer/serialization/saver.py`
- `src/composer/serialization/exporter.py`
- `src/composer/serialization/validator.py`

**Bus contract (History):**
- Subscribes: `composer/command/execute`, `composer/command/undo`, `composer/command/redo`, `composer/file/loaded`, `composer/file/saved`
- Publishes: `composer/history/stack_changed`, `composer/file/dirty`

**Input specs:**
- [CXC-MOD-HISTORY] from 03-composer-modules.lts
- [SPEC:CXC-SERIAL] (04-composer-serialization.lts — entire document)
- Round-trip fidelity rules (ruamel.yaml)
- Export pipeline: .compose.yaml → deployment ComposeIO YAML
- 30 validation rules from ../spec/02-composeio-config-schema.smd

**Key deliverables:**
- Command stack (100 depth, batch-aware).
- Undo: pop, publish reverse command, push to redo stack.
- Redo: pop redo, publish forward command, push to undo stack.
- Dirty tracking (publishes `composer/file/dirty`).
- `.compose.yaml` loader (ruamel.yaml round-trip mode).
- `.compose.yaml` saver (preserves comments, ordering, quoting).
- ComposeIO YAML exporter (one file per module + bindings file).
- Design validator (all 30 rules, returns errors + warnings).
- Round-trip test: load → save → byte-compare.

**Test:** Publish 5 `composer/command/execute` events. Verify `composer/history/stack_changed` reports `can_undo: true`. Publish `composer/command/undo` x5. Verify all reverse commands published. Verify `can_undo: false, can_redo: true`.

