- Bus Monitor: live message stream with color-coded types.
- Message filter toggles (state, event, binding, heartbeat, discovery).
- Namespace filter dropdown.
- Pop-out to separate CTkToplevel window.
- 150-line scrollback.

**Test:** Instantiate Connection with mock internal bus and real design bus. Verify `composer/connection/status = offline` published. Add in-process transport with simulated module. Verify `composer/connection/discovery` published with module info.

