## 4. Shared Inputs (All Agents Receive)

Every Phase 1 agent receives:
1. `src/composer/module_base.py` — ComposerModule base class (from Phase 0).
2. `src/composer/buses.py` — Dual-bus factory (from Phase 0).
3. `src/composer/design.py` — DesignDocument state model (from Phase 0).
4. `02-composer-internal-bus.lts` — The bus namespace contract.
5. `03-composer-modules.lts` — Their specific module contract section.
6. Access to the ComposeIO Python library at `../python/composeio/`.
7. Access to `zb_widgets` at `/Users/davidleeburnett/zerowidgets/`.
8. Access to the ComposeIO simulator at `../simulator/` (for widget reference implementations).

